 hine music and a packed beach stage. This is the kind of day where the vib
 e starts early and builds naturally as the crowd comes together on the san
 d for an unforgettable oceanfront party. Timmy Maia will be on the beach s
 tage delivering the soundtrack for Brazil Day at Ballard’s with a perfor
 mance that keeps the energy high and the beach moving. Expect feel good gr
 ooves\, big singalong moments\, and a set that fits perfectly with the oce
 an backdrop and the festive spirit of the day. Whether you are celebrating
  with friends\, making a weekend out of it\, or just looking for the best 
 beach stage atmosphere on Block Island\, this is the event to plan around.
